**Verdict:** The D-VVS1 IGI at [$7,891](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27493916?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) complete is the right answer for almost every lab buyer at 4ct. The D-IF and D-FL options at [$16,858](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28885001?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) are [$8,967](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28885001?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) more for a clarity designation no eye can detect in a radiant cut. Spend that money on the setting or save it.

> **Farzana on Lab 4ct:**
