> The D-IF and D-FL grades at [$16,858](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28885001?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) are for buyers who need the certificate to say a specific thing. They are not for buyers who want a more beautiful or larger-looking stone — because at 4ct radiant, VVS1 is already eye-clean with nothing left to gain visually.

